      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "Some English-speaking ~ fans went straight to this line in the Japanese script to see if it revealed any more details about \"G\", but Toby had already anticipated them",
        "raw": "Some English-speaking ~\nfans went straight\nto this line in the\nJapanese script to see\nif it revealed any more\ndetails about \"G\",\nbut Toby had already\nanticipated them",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
