    {
      "id": "p0152-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "It appears that the speaker starts to say someone's name, then stops before saying too much. There are several characters in Undertale with names that start with \"G\", including Grillby, Gerson, Gyftrot, and Glyde. But the prevailing theory among English-speaking fans is that \"G\" is actually referring to an incredibly mysterious and eerie character named Gaster.",
        "raw": "It appears that the speaker starts to say someone's name, then stops before\nsaying too much. There are several characters in Undertale with names that\nstart with \"G\", including Grillby, Gerson, Gyftrot, and Glyde. But the prevailing\ntheory among English-speaking fans is that \"G\" is actually referring to an\nincredibly mysterious and eerie character named Gaster.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29191832,
          0.35318571,
          0.90145286,
          0.43865
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28900159,
          0.35247143,
          0.90349969,
          0.43972143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          20,
          21,
          22,
          23,
          24
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "来电者似乎刚说出某个人名字的开头，就在透露更多之前停住了。Undertale 有几个角色的名字以“G”开头，包括 Grillby、Gerson、Gyftrot 和 Glyde。不过，英语粉丝中最流行的猜测是：“G”指的是那个极为神秘、诡异的角色 Gaster。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 29,
            "end": 38,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
