    {
      "id": "p0152-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby has been notoriously quiet when fans ask about certain details in Undertale. As a creator, he wants certain mysteries to remain mysteries, so he only left one short note about this line in the translation spreadsheet:",
        "raw": "Toby has been notoriously quiet when fans ask about certain details in\nUndertale. As a creator, he wants certain mysteries to remain mysteries, so he\nonly left one short note about this line in the translation spreadsheet:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29191832,
          0.45393571,
          0.88735023,
          0.50266429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28900159,
          0.45322143,
          0.90349969,
          0.50373571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          25,
          26,
          27
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "粉丝问起 Undertale 的某些细节时，Toby 向来守口如瓶。作为作者，他希望某些谜团始终保持神秘。因此，他只在翻译表格里为这句台词留下一条简短注释：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 5,
            "end": 14,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
