    {
      "id": "p0152-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "As we've already seen, the translation process can reveal details not found in the original work. In this case, because the Japanese language is based on syllables and not sounds, a standard translation of \"can I speak to G?\" into Japanese would result in a vowel appearing after \"G\". This would reveal more information about G's identity - enough for fans to solve this mystery. Toby understood this, and eventually firmly requested that this text remain completely in English. And, as he suggested, leaving it in English would make the line feel even stranger for Japanese players.",
        "raw": "As we've already seen, the translation process can reveal details not found\nin the original work. In this case, because the Japanese language is based on\nsyllables and not sounds, a standard translation of \"can I speak to G?\" into\nJapanese would result in a vowel appearing after \"G\". This would reveal\nmore information about G's identity - enough for fans to solve this mystery.\nToby understood this, and eventually firmly requested that this text remain\ncompletely in English. And, as he suggested, leaving it in English would make\nthe line feel even stranger for Japanese players.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29104842,
          0.56344286,
          0.89026696,
          0.70415
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28900159,
          0.56272857,
          0.90349969,
          0.70522143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          30,
          31,
          32,
          33,
          34,
          35,
          36,
          37
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "前面已经看到，翻译有时会透露原作里没有的信息。在这里，日语假名表示音节，而非单个音素，按通常方式翻译“请问 G 在吗”，就会在“G”后加上一个元音。这会透露更多关于 G 身份的信息，足以让粉丝解开谜团。Toby 明白这一点，后来明确要求这段文字全部保留英文。而且正如他所说，保留英文会让日本玩家觉得这句台词更加古怪。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29173922,
          0.56201429,
          0.90145286,
