    {
      "id": "p0152-b010",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby didn’t explain \"G\" in his translation notes, so the localizers originally assumed it was meant to refer to Gaster, thus \"G\" became ガ (Ga) for a short time.",
        "raw": "Toby didn't explain ~\n\"G\" in his translation\nnotes, so the\nlocalizers originally\nassumed it was meant\nto refer to Gaster, thus\n\"G\" became tS (Ga) for\na short time",
